 - Count only nonzero values for `pts` and `pts_rest` of the exact Wilcoxon test in {func}`~rapids_singlecell.tl.rank_genes_groups` when sparse input stores explicit zeros, as scanpy does {pr}`868` {smaller}`S Dicks`
